Dither Kit, by ripgrim / Boring Software Inc.
Source: https://github.com/Boring-Software-Inc/dither-kit
Registry: https://tripwire.sh/r/area-chart.json (core + area-chart, 0.1.0)
Installed with @dither-kit/cli; integrity and file ownership: frontend/dither-kit.json.
The upstream package.json declares the MIT license. No separate LICENSE file
was supplied by the upstream repository at installation time.
These registry sources are retained as supplied except area.tsx uses Vite's
import.meta.env.DEV in place of process.env.NODE_ENV for browser type safety.
No proprietary fonts are bundled. Existing self-hosted Geist and JetBrains Mono
remain under their original font licenses in public/fonts.

